        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: മാനസികാവസ്ഥ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാനസികാവസ്ഥ — mānasikāvastha — \"a state of mind; a mood\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരീക്ഷയ്ക്ക് മുൻപ് അവന്റെ മാനസികാവസ്ഥ മോശമായിരുന്നു. parīkṣaykkŭ munpŭ avanṟe mānasikāvastha mōśamāyirunnu. Before the exam he was in a bad state of mind."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാനസിക of the mind + അവസ്ഥ a state: the two vowels join into one long ആ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാനസികാവസ്ഥ (mānasikāvastha) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit mānasika, \"of the mind\" (Monier-Williams), and avasthā, \"a state, a condition\" (CDIAL 872)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
