          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പിറുപിറുക്കുക (piṟupiṟukkuka) is a doubled sound-word like മുറുമുറുക്കുക; DEDR has no entry that clearly holds it, so its origin is not settled."
            }
